<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "roll a face's lease epoch forward by a signed advance"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.lease.rolls", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.lease.rolls"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.lease.rolls"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.lease.rolls ~ stale grants go cold

`lares persona lease [<index>]` has the persona root sign its lease epoch forward by one; stale grants go cold and the sealed anchor's frontier rises to the epoch that verified. Absent, the index reads 0.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ lease

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`lease` params=`index/1 ~ advance face h1's lease`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ index

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`index` params=`takes/handle-index seat/1 as/<index> ~ the face's handle index, a whole number from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ signs under the persona root`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.lease.rolls index/1]] ~ the index reads out of range`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ rolled

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`rolled` params=`exit/0 fields/[[effective rolled frontier]] ~ the lease advanced`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona lease

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares persona lease]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

